#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "Accessible wheelchair-taxi booking theme for Melbourne. Online bookings with repeat trips, account/invoice and Stripe deposits; customer booking lookup; wp-admin bookings manager with calendar, run sheet, reports, driver & vehicle assignment and CSV export; SMS (ClickSend/Twilio) and email notifications; driver job pages; FAQ, fleet, NDIS, service and suburb pages; SEO structured data; spam protection; page templates (About, Contact, Services, Blog, Policy, Full width, Canvas) and block patterns; Google address suggestions and fare estimates; cookie consent + GA4; breadcrumbs and local SEO; security hardening; fluid \"dynamic type\" with text-size and high-contrast controls."
msgstr ""

