#: inc/content-types.php:357
msgid "Travel seated in your manual or power wheelchair, or transfer to a seat — your choice."
msgstr ""

#: inc/content-types.php:358
msgid ""
"Our wheelchair accessible taxis (WATs) let you travel seated in your own manual or power wheelchair, or transfer to a vehicle seat if you prefer.\n"
"\n"
"Every trip is door-to-door. Your driver will help you on and off the ramp or hoist, secure your chair with restraints, and make sure you are comfortable before setting off.\n"
"\n"
"Tell us about your chair when you book — its size, weight and whether it is manual or powered — so we can send the right vehicle."
msgstr ""

#: inc/content-types.php:361
msgid "Medical & hospital trips"
msgstr ""

#: inc/content-types.php:363
msgid "Appointments, dialysis, rehab and discharge pick-ups at hospitals across Melbourne and the Peninsula."
msgstr ""

#: inc/content-types.php:364
msgid ""
"We take passengers to GP and specialist appointments, dialysis, rehabilitation, day surgery and hospital discharges.\n"
"\n"
"Give us your appointment time and we will plan the pick-up so you arrive relaxed. For regular treatment such as dialysis, you can set up repeat bookings in one go.\n"
"\n"
"If you are being discharged and don't know the exact time yet, call us and we will arrange a pick-up when you are ready."
msgstr ""

#: inc/content-types.php:367
msgid "Airport transfers"
msgstr ""

#: inc/content-types.php:369
msgid "Melbourne (Tullamarine) and Avalon airports, with room for luggage and mobility equipment."
msgstr ""

#: inc/content-types.php:370
msgid ""
"Accessible transfers to and from Melbourne (Tullamarine) and Avalon airports.\n"
"\n"
"Add your flight number in the booking notes. For arrivals, we will check your flight time and meet you at the agreed pick-up point.\n"
"\n"
"Let us know how much luggage and equipment you are travelling with so we can make sure it all fits."
msgstr ""

#: inc/content-types.php:373
#: inc/home.php:115
msgid "NDIS & aged care"
msgstr ""

#: inc/content-types.php:375
msgid "Regular transport for day programs, therapy and social outings. Account and invoice options available."
msgstr ""

#: inc/content-types.php:376
msgid ""
"Reliable transport for NDIS participants and aged-care residents: day programs, therapy, work, shopping and social outings.\n"
"\n"
"Plan managers, support coordinators and providers can book on a participant's behalf and choose to be invoiced."
msgstr ""

#: inc/content-types.php:379
msgid "Group & Maxi travel"
msgstr ""

#: inc/content-types.php:381
msgid "Maxi vehicles for two wheelchairs or larger groups with carers."
msgstr ""

#: inc/content-types.php:382
msgid ""
"Travelling with family, carers or more than one wheelchair user? Our Maxi vehicles carry larger groups, including two wheelchairs where available.\n"
"\n"
"Choose \"Maxi WAT\" when booking and tell us how many people and wheelchairs are travelling."
msgstr ""

#: inc/content-types.php:385
msgid "Events & day trips"
msgstr ""

#: inc/content-types.php:387
msgid "Weddings, footy, concerts and winery tours — booked ahead and on time."
msgstr ""

#: inc/content-types.php:388
msgid ""
"From weddings and family celebrations to the footy, concerts and Peninsula winery tours — book ahead and we will get you there and home again.\n"
"\n"
"For return trips, tick \"I need a return trip\" and tell us roughly when you'd like to be collected."
msgstr ""

