#: inc/incidents.php:399
msgid "1. Contain"
msgstr ""

#: inc/incidents.php:401
msgid "Stop the breach: change passwords, revoke access, recall a wrongly sent email, retrieve lost devices or papers."
msgstr ""

#: inc/incidents.php:402
msgid "If an account was used: sign it out everywhere (Users → edit → \"Log out everywhere else\") and reset its password."
msgstr ""

#: inc/incidents.php:403
msgid "Keep evidence: do not delete logs. Download the activity log (Reports → Activity log) for the period."
msgstr ""

#: inc/incidents.php:404
msgid "Record it now in the incident register (type: Privacy / data breach) with the time you found out."
msgstr ""

#: inc/incidents.php:408
msgid "2. Assess (within 30 days)"
msgstr ""

#: inc/incidents.php:410
msgid "What information was involved (names, phone numbers, addresses, health or disability details, NDIS numbers, payment details)?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/incidents.php:411
msgid "Whose information, and how many people?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/incidents.php:412
msgid "Is serious harm likely — for example identity theft, physical safety, or embarrassment from disability or health details being exposed?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/incidents.php:413
msgid "Can action now prevent the harm (for example the email was recalled unread)? If so, it may not need to be notified."
msgstr ""

#: inc/incidents.php:414
msgid "If you suspect an eligible data breach, the assessment must be done quickly — the OAIC expects it within 30 days."
msgstr ""

#: inc/incidents.php:418
msgid "3. Notify"
msgstr ""

#: inc/incidents.php:420
msgid "If it is an eligible data breach (likely serious harm that could not be prevented), notify the OAIC and the people affected as soon as practicable."
msgstr ""

#: inc/incidents.php:421
msgid "The Notifiable Data Breaches scheme covers businesses under the Privacy Act — generally those with turnover over $3 million, and also smaller businesses that provide a health service. Check with the OAIC whether it applies to you; notifying voluntarily is still good practice."
msgstr ""

#: inc/incidents.php:422
msgid "If NDIS participants are affected and you are a registered NDIS provider, check whether it is also a reportable incident for the NDIS Commission."
msgstr ""

#: inc/incidents.php:423
msgid "Tell people what happened, what information was involved, what you are doing, and what they should do (for example watch for scam calls)."
msgstr ""

#: inc/incidents.php:427
msgid "4. Review"
msgstr ""

#: inc/incidents.php:429
msgid "Why did it happen? What will stop it happening again (training, settings, a process change)?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/incidents.php:430
msgid "Update this plan and close the incident with the outcome."
msgstr ""

