#. translators: %s: business name
#: inc/privacy.php:1091
#, php-format
msgid "%s (\"we\", \"us\") provides wheelchair accessible taxi transport. This policy explains what personal information we collect, why, who we share it with and how you can see, correct or delete it. We follow the Privacy Act 1988 (Cth) and the Australian Privacy Principles (APPs)."
msgstr ""

#: inc/privacy.php:1095
msgid "What we collect"
msgstr ""

#: inc/privacy.php:1097
msgid "Contact details: name, mobile number and email address."
msgstr ""

#: inc/privacy.php:1098
msgid "Trip details: pick-up and drop-off addresses, dates and times, number of passengers, and the vehicle you need."
msgstr ""

#: inc/privacy.php:1099
msgid "Health and mobility information"
msgstr ""

#: inc/privacy.php:1099
msgid "your mobility aid, chair size and weight, and any needs you tell us about so the driver can help you safely. This is \"sensitive information\" under the APPs. We only collect it with your consent, and only what we need for your trip."
msgstr ""

#: inc/privacy.php:1100
msgid "Payment and funding details: how you pay, Multi Purpose Taxi Program membership, and for account trips the organisation or plan manager we invoice and an NDIS number or purchase order."
msgstr ""

#: inc/privacy.php:1101
msgid "If you open an account: your saved passengers or clients and saved addresses."
msgstr ""

#: inc/privacy.php:1102
msgid "Ratings and comments you give about a trip, and messages you send us."
msgstr ""

#: inc/privacy.php:1103
msgid "If you apply to drive with us: the details in your application, including your accreditation."
msgstr ""

#: inc/privacy.php:1104
msgid "Website information: your IP address (to stop spam and misuse) and, only if you accept analytics cookies, how you use the website."
msgstr ""

#: inc/privacy.php:1106
msgid "You can ask about our services without giving your name. To book a trip we need enough detail to collect you and contact you."
msgstr ""

#: inc/privacy.php:1108
msgid "How we collect it"
msgstr ""

#: inc/privacy.php:1109
msgid "Directly from you when you book, call, text or email us, or from someone booking for you — a family member, carer, support coordinator, plan manager, aged-care home or hospital. If you book for someone else, please make sure they are happy for you to give us their details."
msgstr ""

#: inc/privacy.php:1111
msgid "Why we use it"
msgstr ""

#: inc/privacy.php:1113
msgid "To arrange, run and change your trips, and send the right vehicle."
msgstr ""

#: inc/privacy.php:1114
msgid "To send booking confirmations and updates by SMS and email, such as when your driver is on the way."
msgstr ""

#: inc/privacy.php:1115
msgid "To take payment, issue receipts and invoices, and process MPTP and NDIS claims."
msgstr ""

#: inc/privacy.php:1116
msgid "For safety, to handle complaints and incidents, and to improve our service using your ratings."
msgstr ""

#: inc/privacy.php:1117
msgid "To meet our legal obligations, including commercial passenger vehicle and tax laws."
msgstr ""

#: inc/privacy.php:1119
msgid "We do not sell your information, and we do not send marketing messages without your permission."
msgstr ""

#: inc/privacy.php:1121
msgid "Who we share it with"
msgstr ""

#: inc/privacy.php:1123
msgid "The driver doing your trip sees your name, phone number, addresses and the needs you have told us about. Drivers only see their own trips."
msgstr ""

#: inc/privacy.php:1124
msgid "People you ask us to deal with, such as the coordinator, plan manager or facility that booked or pays for your trip."
msgstr ""

#: inc/privacy.php:1125
msgid "Government bodies and police when the law requires it, for example the regulator or police after an incident."
msgstr ""

